<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - PaineWebber raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Credit Suisse First Boston said on Monday it had raised its rating for PaineWebber Group Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the New York financial services company closed on Friday at 31-3/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
